        "text": "Extract the following details from this receipt image: merchant name, total amount, date, payment method, receipt/transaction/reference number, cashier name, and tax/VAT amount. If any field is not visible or not present on the receipt, return an empty string for that field. Return ONLY valid JSON in this exact format with no extra text or markdown: {\"merchant\": \"\", \"amount\": \"\", \"date\": \"\", \"paymentMethod\": \"\", \"referenceNumber\": \"\", \"cashierName\": \"\", \"tax\": \"\"}",
